Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:29:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Add minimal query builder to the core

Model::query() returns a QueryBuilder with where, orderBy, get and
paginate. Values are bound as numbered placeholders; columns, operators
and directions come from closed lists. Paginator accepts the builder's
WHERE fragment, bindings and ORDER BY.
